{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09671","headline":"敷水歌送窦渐入京 · 岑参","name":"敷水歌送窦渐入京","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"罗敷昔时秦氏女，千载无人空处所。\n昔时流水至今流，万事皆逐东流去。\n此水东流无尽期，水声还似旧来时。\n岸花仍自羞红脸，堤柳犹能学翠眉。\n春去秋来不相待，水中月色长不改。\n罗敷养蚕空耳闻，使君五马今何在？\n九月霜天水正寒，故人西去度征鞍。\n水底鲤鱼幸无数，愿君别後垂尺素。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"岑参","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09671.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09671","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}